{"updated":"2026-10-22","cycleStart":"2025-01-01","body":{"key":"flhouse","name":{"en":"Florida House","es":"Cámara de Representantes de Florida","ht":"Chanm Reprezantan Florid"},"type":"requests","level":null,"members":[{"key":"Basabe","name":"Fabián Basabe"},{"key":"Gantt","name":"Ashley Viola Gantt"},{"key":"Blanco","name":"Omar Blanco"},{"key":"Chambliss","name":"Kevin Chambliss"},{"key":"Redondo","name":"Mike Redondo"},{"key":"Porras","name":"Juan Carlos Porras"},{"key":"Nixon","name":"Angie Nixon"}],"onBallot":{"Gantt":{"race":{"en":"State Senate, District 34","es":"Senado estatal, Distrito 34","ht":"Sena Leta, Distri 34"},"accounts":["gantt"]}},"accounts":{"gantt":{"owner":"Gantt","name":{"en":"Ashley Viola Gantt campaign","es":"Campaña de Ashley Viola Gantt","ht":"Kanpay Ashley Viola Gantt"},"url":"https://dos.elections.myflorida.com/candidates/CanDetail.asp?account=88947"}},"registries":[{"name":{"en":"Florida Legislature lobbyist registrations","es":"Registro de cabilderos de la Legislatura de Florida","ht":"Rejis lobiyis Lejislati Florid"},"url":"https://www.floridalobbyist.gov/"}]},"actions":[{"id":"HV26-1137-1586","date":"2026-02-25","ref":"HB 1137 · 2026","kind":"bill","subject":{"en":"Deductions for Certain Losses of Alcoholic Beverages","es":"Deductions for Certain Losses of Alcoholic Beverages","ht":"Deductions for Certain Losses of Alcoholic Beverages"},"parties":[],"result":"passed","tally":[116,0],"notVoting":1,"roll":{"Basabe":"yes","Gantt":"yes","Blanco":"yes","Chambliss":"yes","Redondo":"yes","Porras":"yes","Nixon":"yes"},"rollComplete":false,"lobbied":[],"gifts":[{"to":"Gantt","acct":"gantt","kind":"class","rel":"cls","donor":"FLORIDA BEER WHOLESALERS GOOD GOVERNMENT COMMITTEE","amount":1000,"date":"2025-11-24","occ":"PAC"}],"note":{"en":"Floor vote: passage in the House. The House staff analysis of the bill says: “The bill allows alcoholic beverage distributors a deduction from alcoholic beverage excise taxes for standard product losses, including losses caused by breakage, spoilage, evaporation, or expiration.” Donors listed are alcoholic beverage distributors and the beer wholesalers’ political committee, as their names and reported occupations appear in the campaign finance reports; this does not claim they asked for the bill or for this vote. Gifts are shown with the dates recorded, including any after the vote. The bill became law (Ch. 2026-41).","es":"Votación en el pleno: aprobación en la Cámara. El análisis del personal de la Cámara dice (en inglés; traducción): “El proyecto permite a los distribuidores de bebidas alcohólicas deducir de los impuestos especiales sobre esas bebidas las pérdidas normales de producto, incluidas las causadas por rotura, deterioro, evaporación o vencimiento.” Los donantes que aparecen son distribuidores de bebidas alcohólicas y el comité político de los mayoristas de cerveza, según sus nombres y ocupaciones en los reportes de campaña; esto no afirma que pidieran el proyecto ni este voto. Las donaciones se muestran con las fechas registradas, incluso las posteriores al voto. El proyecto se convirtió en ley (Ch. 2026-41).","ht":"Vòt nan sesyon plenyè: adopsyon nan Chanm nan. Analiz anplwaye Chanm nan di (an angle; tradiksyon): “Pwojè lwa a pèmèt distribitè bwason ki gen alkòl dedui nan taks espesyal sou bwason sa yo pèt nòmal pwodwi, tankou pèt akòz kase, gate, evapore oswa ekspire.” Donatè ki parèt yo se distribitè bwason ki gen alkòl ak komite politik grosis byè yo, jan non yo ak travay yo parèt nan rapò finansman kanpay yo; sa pa di yo te mande pwojè lwa a ni vòt sa a. Kado yo parèt ak dat yo anrejistre, menm sa ki vini apre vòt la. Pwojè a te tounen lwa (Ch. 2026-41)."},"motion":"Passage","links":[{"t":"vote","url":"https://www.flsenate.gov/Session/Bill/2026/1137/Vote/HouseVote_h01137c1586.PDF"},{"t":"analysis","url":"https://www.flsenate.gov/Session/Bill/2026/1137/Analyses/h1137f.COM.PDF"},{"t":"bill","url":"https://www.flsenate.gov/Session/Bill/2026/1137"}]},{"id